          <video controls="" muted="" loop="" playsinline="">
            <source src="/images/Project/ARCCSRL-Robotic-Limb/EGCCSRL_DEMO_FOOTAGE_EDITED-3.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          </video>
          <div class="arc-video-duration">00:11:20</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Results & Takeaways -->
        <section class="content-grid-2col">
          <div class="text-section">
            <span class="section-kicker">{% if zh %}成果與洞察{% else %}Outcomes{% endif %}</span>
            <h3>{% if zh %}成果與心得{% else %}Results And Takeaways{% endif %}</h3>
            <p>{% if zh %}這次研究中，Harry 負責建立視覺資產並協助進行使用者測試。透過 22 次的使用者測試協議，團隊蒐集了大量的互動數據並進行分析。最終成果在哈佛創新實驗室與 MIT Media Lab 展出，引發廣泛討論，並受到業界廣泛關注。{% else %}
              During this research, Harry contributed visual assets and assisted in conducting user testing sessions.
              Through 22 user testing protocols, the team collected and analyzed extensive interaction data.
              The final outcomes were exhibited at Harvard Innovation Labs and MIT Media Lab, generating broad
              discussion and attracting significant attention from the industry.
            {% endif %}</p>
            <p>{% if zh %}主要貢獻包含：視覺傳達圖片產出、協助完成 22 人次的使用者測試、將測試數據轉化為直觀的資料視覺化圖表、設計最終的發表簡報，以及在哈佛與 MIT 的公開成果展出。{% else %}
              Key contributions: visual communication asset production, supporting 22 user testing sessions,
              transforming complex experimental data into intuitive visualizations, designing the final
              presentation report, and showcasing research outcomes at Harvard &amp; MIT.
            {% endif %}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="media-block media-block--flush">
            <div class="image-wrapper">
              <img src="/images/Project/ARCCSRL-Robotic-Limb/CITI%20Research.webp" alt="CITI Research Certificate" loading="lazy">
            </div>
